        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, iambire Jerusalemu mamboge ga kutsukiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaiambira Jerusalemu hivi: Asiliyo na kuvyalwako ni tsi ya Kanani, sowe ni Muamori na mayoo ni Muhiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriphovyalwa kukatirwe tovu, chisha kuogeserwe na madzi ga kukuhenda ukale swafi wala kupakpwa munyu au kulingbwa nguwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna mutu ariyekuonera mbazi na kukuhendera mambo gago, ela siku uriphovyalwa waberwa na uchitsuphiwa weruni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nami nriphotsupa phephi na phapho uriphokala, nchikuona unagalagala kahi za milatsoyo. Uriphokala umo mwako milatsoni, nchikuamba, “Kala moyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchikuhenda ukule dza mmea wa weruni. Uwe wakula na uchikala msichana mnono sana uchihenda nyaho na nyerezo zichikala nyire, ela uchikala u chitsaha bila nguwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Niriphotsupa tsona nákuona ukakula nawe kala ukafika wa kuphaha wende, nchihala vwazi rangu nchibwiningiza chitsahacho, narya chirapho nchiika chilagane na uwe, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, nawe uchikala wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchikuogesa na madzi, nakuogesa, nchisafisha nyo mlatsoo na nchikupaka mafuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchikuvwika nguwo zoshonwa marembo na nchikuvwika virahu vya chingo ya pomboo, nchikufunga chitambaa swafi cha katani mwako chitswani na nchikubwiningiza mtandiyo wa hariri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchikupamba na mapambo na kukuvwika bangili mwako mikononi na mkpwufu mwako singoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchikuvwika chishaufu mwako pulani, vipuli mwako masikironi na tadzi nono dzulu ya chitswacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe wapambwa na zahabu na feza, nguwozo kala ni katani na hariri swafi chizoshonwa marembo. Uchirya chakurya cha unga mnono, asali na mafuha ga zaituni. Nawe uchikala mnono sana hata uchifikira kukala dza Malikiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngumayo ichienea kahi za mataifa ganjina kpwa sababu ya unonoo. Mana unonoo kala ukakamilika kpwa yo nguma niriyokupha, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ela wakuluphira unonoo na kumanyikanako kpwa kuhenda udiya, uchilala na chila mutu yetsupira phephi, na unonoo uchikala wakpwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe wahala seemu ya nguwozo uchizipamba mizukayo, na uchizinga phapho. Dzambo riro taridzangbwehendeka na tarindahendeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya wahala mapambogo manono gotengezwa na zahabu na feza nrizokupha uchitengezera vizuka mfwano wa alume na uchizinga navyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha uchihala nguwozo zoshonwa marembo uchivibwiningiza na uchivipha mafuha gangu na uvumba wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata cho chakurya cha unga mnono, mafuha na asali nriyokupha urye, piya waipha yo mifwano ya atu ikale sadaka yenye kungu nono. Hivyo ndivyo irivyokala, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phamwenga na gago, wahala anao, urionivyarira, uchialavya sadaka kpwa vyo vizuka ili virye. Nyo umalaya wenu kala tautosha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata mchitsindza anangu na kuipha yo mifwano ya atu dza sadaka ya kuochwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kahi ya mambogo gosi ga kutsukiza na kuzingako, kuyatambukira wakati wa usichanao, uriphokala chitsaha bila nguwo, unagalagala kahi ya milatsoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Shaka hiro! Shaka hiro! Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, mana phamwenga na uyio wosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wadzidzengera mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kuabudira vizuka chila muhala wa mudzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadzenga phatu pha dzulu pha kuabudira vizuka kpwenye maganiko ga chila barabara, nawe uchitiya ila unonoo kpwa kuzidi kuzinga na chila yetsupa na njira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha uchizinga na Amisiri, majiranigo ga mkpwatyo, nawe uchizidisha uzembeo ili nitsukirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo lola, nágolosa mkpwono wangu chinyumecho nchiphunguza mtaloo wa seemu ya tsi na nchiupha maaduigo matoni, nyo Afilisti, arioona waibu kpwa tabiyazo mbii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala kutoshekere, wazinga na Aashuru. Na vivyo piya tavikutoshere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uchizinga na tsi ya Akalidayo, tsi ya ahendadzi-bishara, ela kutoshekere vivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Nyo moyoo ni mui chiasi gani hata uhende mambo gosi higa, avi umalaya asiye na haya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe wadzidzengera mwatu mwa dzulu mwa ibada za vizuka kpwenye chila maganiko na chila muhala wa mudzi. Ela kuyakala dza malaya anjina mana warema kuriphiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe u dza mchetu amendzaye kulala na alume anjina kuriko kulala na mlumewe mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila malaya nkuriphiwa, ela we ukuripha azembeo na kuahonga ili edze kula chila uphande wedze uzinge nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi kuzingako kutafwauti na achetu anjina kpwa kukala taphana akulungaye, uwe ndiwe ulungaye azembeo na badala ya aho kukuripha, we ukuaripha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kpwa hivyo, uwe malaya, hega sikiro usikire vyo Mwenyezi Mlungu aambavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Kpwa sababu ya mkpwatyoo munji, chitsahacho kuonewa ni azembeo kahi za umalayao, vizukavyo vyosi vya kutsukiza na milatso ya anao urioapha vizuka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndakusanya azembeo ambao mwahamirwa phamwenga, osi urioamendza na osi urioamena. Ndaakusanya chinyumecho kula chila uphande nikuvule nguwo mbere zao aone chitsahacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nindakutiya adabu dza achetu ariolólwa kuno ni azindzi na ni aolagadzi. Kpwa tsukizi zangu na wivu wangu nindakuamula chifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nindakutiya mikononi mwa azembeo, nao andabomola mwatumo mwa kuabudira vizuka na kuvundza mwatumo mwa dzulu. Aho andakuvula nguwo, ahale mapambogo na akuriche chitsaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andakufyakatsira atu akupige mawe na akukate vipande-vipande na panga zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho andaocha nyumbazo na akutiye adabu mbere za achetu anji. Nindakuhenda uriche kukala malaya na nkuhende uriche kuhonga azembeo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho ndipho tsukizi zangu zindadigirika, nami sindakutsukirirwa na kukuhendera wivu tsona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa sababu kuyatambukira siku za usichanao ela wanitsukiza kpwa kuhenda mai gosi higa, nindadziriphiza kpwa dambizo, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba. Kpwa utu wani go mambogo mai urigohenda wagaenjereza na kuzinga?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Lola, chila mutu ndiyehumira ndarira andakala anakuhadza uwe, nao andaamba, “Vyo arivyo mayo ndivyo arivyo mwanawe mchetu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe u mwana mchetu wa mayoo ariyericha mlumewe na anae, nawe u ndugu mchetu wa nduguzo a chichetu arioricha alume aho na ana ao. Mayoo kala ni Muhiti na sowe kala ni Muamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mvyereo mchetu kala ni Samariya, ariyesagala na anae achetu uphandeo wa vurini. Na mdideo mchetu kala ni Sodoma, ariyesagala na anae achetu uphandeo wa mwakani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:46",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mvyereo mchetu ina mana ya mudzi mkpwulu na anae achetu ni midzi midide chiyozunguluka nyo mudzi mkpwulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe kuyalunga njira zao na kuhenda kulengana na mambo gao ga kutsukiza tu, ela kpwa muda mchache njirazo zosi zichikala mbii kuriko zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba: Kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo, Sodoma, mwenenu mchetu na anae achetu taahendere dza uwe na anao achetu murivyohenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, makosa ga mwenenu mchetu Sodoma na anae achetu ni higa: Kudziunula na kusaterya achiya na akutsowa, dzagbwe kala akaongokerwa na kala ana chakurya chinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao adzikarya na achihenda mambo ga kutsukiza mbere zangu, kpwa sababu ya gago, náausa dza mrivyoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata Samariya taidzangbwehenda nusu ya makosa urigohenda uwe. Uwe ukahenda mambo manji ga kutsukiza kuriko aho na kuahenda enenu achetu aonekane ni a haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe nawe, gbwirwa ni waibu, mana ukaahenda enenu achetu akale na haki kuriko uwe. Kpwa kukala dambi urizohenda ni za kutsukiza kuriko zao, phahi gbwirwa ni waibu mana ukaahenda enenu achetu aonekane a haki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nami nindauyizira Sodoma na anae achetu, Samariya na anae achetu phamwenga na uwe, kuongokerwa kpwenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili ugbwirwe ni waibu kpwa gosi urigogahenda na kuaphoza marenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi enenu achetu, Sodoma na Samariya na ana aho achetu andauyizwa vyo arivyokala pho mwandzo na uwe na anao achetu mundauyizwa vyo murivyokala pho mwandzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana mwenenu mchetu Sodoma, kumhadzire kpwa kauliyo siku za kudzikaryako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabila uyio taudzangbwemanyikana. Vivi ukakala wa kuzemererwa ni ana achetu a Edomu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:57",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vina dzina Aramu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na majiranige gosi na ana achetu a Afilisti, yani osi akuzungulukao anaokubera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Ni uvumirire kutiywa adabu kpwa uyio na mambogo ga kutsukiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
